  <h1 class="mb-4 text-2xl">Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="mb-4">Optional audience measurement is disabled unless the site owner configures it at build time. If enabled, this site uses PostHog to count visits and selected filter and share actions, so the owner can understand use of the site.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">The planned configuration uses cookieless mode and does not create person profiles. It sends the fixed page path and selected predefined filter values, not search text or shared URL parameters. PostHog still receives network information, including IP address and user agent. The site also sends no HTTP referrer to other sites.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">The retention period depends on the PostHog project settings and has not yet been confirmed. The owner must confirm and publish it before enabling analytics. Consent requirements and the deployed configuration must also be reviewed before activation.</p>
